## Credibility score — assign at extraction time

| Score | Meaning |
|---|---|
| 1 | Single study, small cohort, single population, unreplicated, often candidate-gene era 90s/2000s |
| 2 | Single study but larger cohort, or biologically well-motivated locus with mechanistic support |
| 3 | Replicated in at least one independent sample, or multi-site study with reasonable power |
| 4 | Multiple independent replications, consistent direction of effect across populations |
| 5 | Meta-analyzed with formal statistical pooling, or consensus-level field evidence |

