```
Does the paper test a TR locus or TR class as the candidate variant
(not positional scaffolding, not SNPs, not CNVs)?
        |
       NO → EXCLUDE
        |
       YES
        |
Is the outcome a genuine human psychiatric, behavioral,
neurodevelopmental, or personality disorder/phenotype
(not purely neurological, not animal only, not fMRI signal alone,
not non-psychiatric medical condition)?
        |
       NO → EXCLUDE
        |
       YES
        |
Was a positive association found (not null)?
        |
       NO → EXCLUDE
        |
       YES
        |
If an established TR disorder is involved — is the paper actually
studying a psychiatric/behavioral finding, not just mentioning one?
        |
       NO → EXCLUDE
        |
       YES → INCLUDE ✅
              → assign credibility 1–5
              → note locus, disorder, direction of effect
```